OL,3,ASupermarket freezers in Belgium and
OL,4,ASweden hit by suspected cyber-attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of supermarkets in Belgium and
OL,7,FSweden have been hit by a suspected
OL,8,Fcyber-attack affecting its
OL,9,Frefrigerators and freezers.
OL,11,FAround 40 Delhaize supermarkets and 15
OL,12,FCarrefour stores were affected in
OL,13,FBelgium, while several ICA and Coop
OL,14,Fshops in Sweden were hit. Thirteen
OL,15,FSuperValu shops have also been impacted
OL,16,Fin Ireland.
OL,18,FThousands of euros worth of food has
OL,19,Fhad to be thrown away, according to
OL,20,Flocal media reports, with one ICA store
OL,21,Fin Sweden saying temperatures for its
OL,22,Ffreezers had been set to 50 C (122F).
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
