OL,3,ASupermarket freezers in Belgium and
OL,4,ASweden hit by suspected cyber-attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not clear who is behind the
OL,7,Fattack, which follows a similar
OL,8,Fincident last month that affected
OL,9,Fhundreds of French supermarkets.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
